    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "###PROPERTY AT A GLANCE ###\r\n#####SUPERBLY LAID OUT AND WELL PROPORTIONED ROOMS THROUGHOUT \r\nLARGE SOUTH FACING BALCONY \r\nMODERN BATHROOM FITTED IN RECENT YEARS \r\nSPACIOUS OPEN PLAN LIVING AND DINING AREA \r\nSEPARATE KITCHEN #######\r\n\r\nEarnest are delighted to present this 1st floor apartment in the popular Smithfield gate development. No. 16 Smithfield gate is a bright and spacious apartment located on North King street across from Smithfield Square. The apartment is currently owner occupier and is sure to attract interest from home owners and investors alike. Nicely presented throughout , the apartment boasts many features including stylish bathroom suite , generously sized south facing balcony, modern and efficient electric heaters throughout to name a few.  \r\n\r\nThe property briefly comprises of a welcoming L shaped entrance hall with storage area currently in use as a utility room , 2 fine size double bedrooms , an open plan living and dining area with access to a south facing balcony that can easily accommodate a table and chairs. Off the living area is a separate kitchen with ample cabinets for storage and also has a dishwasher . A beautiful fully tiled marble effect bathroom suite has been installed recently to a high standard which includes a wall mounted blue tooth mirror. \r\n\r\n\r\nSmithfield is a thriving location with an abundance of cafes, restaurants and recently opened Lidl supermarket. Other places of interest include the Jameson Distillery and the New Grangegorman campus. Excellent public transport at your doorstep with Red & Green Luas lines only a short stroll away. City center is only 15 mins walk away . \r\n\r\nService charge Approx. €2700PA"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation:\r\n\r\nEntrance Hallway: Laminate flooring , access to utility /storage room and hot press \r\n\r\nLiving & Dining room 7.20m x 3.60m : floor to ceiling window , laminate flooring , modern electric heater , access to the balcony \r\n\r\nKitchen 3.26m x 1.69m : Separate kitchen, serving opening , floor and wall cabinets, dishwasher\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 , 4.81m x 2.39m, Spacious , carpet, modern electric heater, built wardrobe\r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 2, 4.80m x 2.41m, Spacious , carpet, modern electric heater, built wardrobe\r\n\r\nBathroom: Fully tiled marble effect, large shower cubicle , blue tooth wall mounted mirror"
      },
      {
